            For dark spots and uneven tone, the Dark Spots, Pore Control Serum combines niacinamide, kojic acid, vitamin C, and bio-retinoids in one leave-on step. If breakouts are driving your pigmentation, the Acne, Blemish Control Serum targets the source.
        </p>

